# Run notes — exp-dogfood-1-muse-toy-quest c3 (muse)

## What was built

- `flappy.html` in this run folder: the three.js Flappy Bird demo (same `flappy` spelling as c1/c2), so the artifact plus traces live in this exp's `runs/` as the exp asks. Module script extracted and verified with `node --check` (pass).
- Child-brief fix from c2 persists: `tapePreamble` states `BP3_RUN_ID` and friends arrive via environment and `bp3` stamps them into verdicts and ledger lines; no `Prefix your FIRST` ritual remains. `./test/induct.sh`: all three ok.

## Lessons

- The author child's edge is `submit` (`todo -> submitted`); `full drive` to landed/`exp_fin` is owned by grade and land steps, so this run does not claim it.
- Verification is static for the demo: no browser was opened, so `page opens` remains for a grader to confirm visually.
